        "Present perfect (have / has + past participle): a past action that matters now, or an experience. \"I have finished my work.\" \"She has visited Delhi twice.\"": "Vollendete Gegenwart (present perfect, have / has + Partizip Perfekt = past participle): eine vergangene Handlung, die jetzt noch wichtig ist, oder eine Erfahrung. \"I have finished my work.\" \"She has visited Delhi twice.\"",
